orroborate the restart.","limitations":["No end-to-end login using the corresponding private key was captured; access is instead established through the exact authorized key, effective sshd policy, active listener, and SSH handshake.","The lifecycle listening-socket snapshot was empty both before and after execution, but direct executor evidence showed SSH listening on port 22 before and after restart."]}
